{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of your own farm, manage your livestock, grow your crops, and sell your fresh products directly in your very own store! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Raise Livestock for Eggs, Milk, and Meat</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start by purchasing chicks, goslings, goat kids, or calves. Build pens to care for them, and collect their produce like eggs and milk. When they are fully grown, you can also sell them as meat products to expand your business offerings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706960/extras/RaiseLivestock.gif?t=1749484735\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Grow and Harvest Your Own Crops</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy seedlings such as chili, cucumber, apple, and tomato. Build planter boxes, plant your crops, and patiently wait for them to grow and bear fruit. Some plants allow for multiple harvests before they stop producing, giving you continuous farming satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706960/extras/GrowandHarvest.gif?t=1749484735\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Run and Manage Your Own Store</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place your harvested crops and livestock products on your store shelves. Set the prices, serve customers at the cashier, and build your reputation as the best local farm store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706960/extras/Run_ManageFarm.gif?t=1749484735\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Hire Employees to Help You Grow</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As your farm and store grow bigger, you can hire employees to assist you. Assign them to help manage the cashier, take care of your livestock, tend to your crops, or restock your store to keep customers happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706960/extras/hireemployee.gif?t=1749484735\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you build the most successful farm and store in town? Get ready to experience the full cycle of farming, ranching, and selling in <strong>Ranch Farm and Store Simulator</strong>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3706960?t=1749484735","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706960/bf8221fb302dd82d9875a1631688d844cbeeb45d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749484735","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706960/b745dd32452e75b696f3916b629f3aabdbf36a10/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749484735","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706960/b745dd32452e75b696f3916b629f3aabdbf36a10/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749484735","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3748080,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of your own farm, manage your livestock, grow your crops, and sell your fresh products directly in your very own store! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Raise Livestock for Eggs, Milk, and Meat</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start by purchasing chicks, goslings, goat kids, or calves. Build pens to care for them, and collect their produce like eggs and milk. When they are fully grown, you can also sell them as meat products to expand your business offerings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706960/extras/RaiseLivestock.gif?t=1749484735\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Grow and Harvest Your Own Crops</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy seedlings such as chili, cucumber, apple, and tomato. Build planter boxes, plant your crops, and patiently wait for them to grow and bear fruit. Some plants allow for multiple harvests before they stop producing, giving you continuous farming satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706960/extras/GrowandHarvest.gif?t=1749484735\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Run and Manage Your Own Store</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place your harvested crops and livestock products on your store shelves. Set the prices, serve customers at the cashier, and build your reputation as the best local farm store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706960/extras/Run_ManageFarm.gif?t=1749484735\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Hire Employees to Help You Grow</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As your farm and store grow bigger, you can hire employees to assist you. Assign them to help manage the cashier, take care of your livestock, tend to your crops, or restock your store to keep customers happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706960/extras/hireemployee.gif?t=1749484735\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you build the most successful farm and store in town? Get ready to experience the full cycle of farming, ranching, and selling in <strong>Ranch Farm and Store Simulator</strong>!</p>","developers":["Bewolba Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706960/1b8b5589d077d8f8d87f8ebc2d4646ee8a8ad6fa/header.jpg?t=1749484735","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257154167,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154167/movie480.mp4?t=1749473474","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154167/movie_max.mp4?t=1749473474"},"name":"Trailer Ranch Farm & Store Simulator","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257154167/5cd131ed2d75d20b847ea080242a69af50c5b40f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749473474","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154167/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749473474","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154167/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749473474"}}],"name":"Ranch Farm and Store Simulator","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 1600 / Intel Core i5-8400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB 